	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nLLR8EEZqGMNZ3u6e",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 13, DX 12, IQ 10, HT 12, HP 14, WILL 11, PER 10, FP 12, SPEED 6, MOVE 6, DODGE 9, DR 3. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "n09xMyvZeqaag5-Vf",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 32 (offense 17, protection 15), threat tier standard, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "nlcC8D-vG3NoL1RUq",
			"text": "Fire Breath: Fire Breath (13): 2d burning, Reach Ranged, cone. The inheritance. A short cone, stated as literal dice because it is a property of the blood, not the arm; it costs the veteran to use and is saved for the moment a shield wall thinks it has won."
		},
		{
			"id": "nD6oYd30EJlEzgft8",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/half-red-dragon-veteran.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "n3vNNWmgdBXTkjQey",
			"text": "Independent build total: 174 points of racial traits plus 18 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nysdIbwgdVTuIkjFD",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Half-Red Dragon Veteran (SRD 5.1); Half-Dragon (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nJYb16xxiSoRcPYgH",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nEJth-VNBPsV74ign",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 100 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nFtTa1znYQRgnLfTY",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nsjFfdMvYl_qGp7Sz",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nsPSRec2lvdlAHmPX",
			"text": "Answers both the 5.1 printed sample and the 3.5 Half-Dragon template heading, as one record: the veteran is what the template's niche looks like on a person."
		},
		{
			"id": "ncTCWVspAoB5lbYdq",
			"text": "Scales are DR as Tough Skin; the dragon-fire immunity of the full-blood is scaled to strong resistance bought as limited DR."
		},
		{
			"id": "nuYhFyfDzCoRhpD1S",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
	],
